recommend keep-going -- %398 IS CLOSED AT ITS ROOT AND EVERY BODY'S PASS CLEARS. The repair is one line of shell and the argument behind it is a law: all thirteen offenders were dated testimony, so the guard's only available repair was forbidden, which proves the population was wrong rather than the exclusions. The transferable half is sharper than the fix -- a control that proves a principle for ONE spelling of a class proves nothing about the second, and case 9 had guarded .md against exactly this drift since 20260825 while the notations walked through beside it. MINE NEXT is %397's named remainder, shared machinery every body runs: a card that reads a reference block BESIDE the prose rather than inside it, so a grade stops depending on whether a table carries terminal periods. Then spool_cloth's eight ClothError paths. YOUR GATES ARE WHERE THEY WERE: %374's receipt chain, %5, %6, %7. NAMED, NOT TAKEN: living .kyri and .bron citations are guarded by neither scan today, zero of them exist, and the day one does either guard must learn the notations; ITINERARY stands at 24,568 of 24,576, eight bytes, and the wall is yours; Dream's package still parks on xy/pier/diverged-20260831-064342.
